---
import DocsLayout from '../../layouts/DocsLayout.astro';
import PageHeader from './PageHeader.astro';
import Callout from './Callout.astro';
import CodeBlock from './CodeBlock.astro';

interface Props { lang: 'en' | 'id' }
const { lang } = Astro.props;
const id = lang === 'id';
---

<DocsLayout title={id ? 'Memulai' : 'Getting Started'}>
  <PageHeader eyebrow="Quick start" title={id ? 'Deploy, Setup, Pair, lalu Integrate' : 'Deploy, Setup, Pair, then Integrate'} description={id ? 'Jalankan satu instance Wago tanpa .env wajib, buat akun admin dari dashboard, pair WhatsApp, lalu gunakan REST API dari backend aplikasi Anda.' : 'Run one Wago instance with no required .env, create the admin account from the dashboard, pair WhatsApp, then call its REST API from your application backend.'} />

  <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-[#fafafa] mb-3">1. {id ? 'Prasyarat' : 'Prerequisites'}</h2>
  <ul class="list-disc pl-5 text-sm text-[#a1a1aa] space-y-2 mb-8"><li>Docker Engine + Docker Compose v2.</li><li>{id ? 'Satu akun WhatsApp yang dapat membuka Linked devices.' : 'One WhatsApp account that can access Linked devices.'}</li><li>{id ? 'Origin HTTPS melalui reverse proxy, tunnel, atau router PaaS bila service dipublikasikan.' : 'An HTTPS origin through a reverse proxy, tunnel, or PaaS router when the service is public.'}</li></ul>

  <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-[#fafafa] mb-3">2. Deploy</h2>
  <CodeBlock label="shell" code={`git clone https://github.com/howlil/wago.git\ncd wago\ndocker compose pull\ndocker compose up -d\ndocker compose ps\ncurl http://127.0.0.1:3000/health`} />
  <CodeBlock label="response" code={`{"status":"ok"}`} />
  <p class="text-sm text-[#71717a] mb-4">{id ? 'Tidak ada .env atau deployment password yang wajib untuk first run. Service dipublish ke 127.0.0.1:3000 dan state persisten disimpan di named volume wago_data.' : 'No .env or deployment password is required for first run. The service is published on 127.0.0.1:3000 and persistent state lives in the wago_data named volume.'}</p>
  <Callout title={id ? 'Claim instance sebelum public exposure' : 'Claim the instance before public exposure'} tone="warning">{id ? 'Fresh instance memakai first-browser ownership. Buat akun admin melalui dashboard sebelum origin Wago yang belum ter-setup dapat diakses jaringan yang tidak dipercaya.' : 'A fresh instance uses first-browser ownership. Create the admin account through the dashboard before an uninitialized Wago origin is reachable from an untrusted network.'}</Callout>
  <Callout title={id ? 'Gunakan HTTPS di depan Wago' : 'Put HTTPS in front of Wago'}>{id ? 'Jangan expose port loopback secara langsung. Gunakan reverse proxy, tunnel, atau router PaaS untuk public access.' : 'Do not expose the loopback port directly. Use a reverse proxy, tunnel, or PaaS router for public access.'}</Callout>

  <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-[#fafafa] mt-9 mb-3">3. {id ? 'Buat akun admin dan pair' : 'Create the admin account and pair'}</h2>
  <ol class="list-decimal pl-5 text-sm text-[#a1a1aa] space-y-2 mb-4">
    <li>{id ? 'Buka dashboard Wago pada origin HTTPS Anda.' : 'Open the Wago dashboard at your HTTPS origin.'}</li>
    <li>{id ? 'Pada fresh instance, buat admin password langsung di Gateway access. Wago menyimpan salted scrypt hash di SQLite dan membuat HttpOnly browser session.' : 'On a fresh instance, create the admin password directly in Gateway access. Wago stores a salted scrypt hash in SQLite and creates an HttpOnly browser session.'}</li>
    <li>{id ? 'Klik Pair WhatsApp. Frontend membuat kandidat API key, memanggil POST /app/bootstrap menggunakan browser session, lalu memulai pairing.' : 'Click Pair WhatsApp. The frontend creates an API-key candidate, calls POST /app/bootstrap using the browser session, then starts pairing.'}</li>
    <li>{id ? 'Simpan raw API key bila external application akan memakai REST API. Server menyimpan hash credential di SQLite, bukan raw generated key.' : 'Save the raw API key if an external application will use the REST API. The server stores the credential hash in SQLite, not the raw generated key.'}</li>
    <li>{id ? 'Buka WhatsApp → Linked devices → Link a device, lalu scan QR.' : 'Open WhatsApp → Linked devices → Link a device, then scan the QR.'}</li>
  </ol>
  <Callout title={id ? 'Bootstrap memerlukan browser session' : 'Bootstrap requires a browser session'} tone="warning">{id ? 'Di production, admin setup dan bootstrap divalidasi terhadap same-origin request. Machine API key bukan credential login dashboard.' : 'In production, admin setup and bootstrap are validated as same-origin requests. The machine API key is not a dashboard login credential.'}</Callout>

  <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-[#fafafa] mt-9 mb-3">{id ? 'Strategi versi saat pairing' : 'Version strategy during pairing'}</h2>
  <p class="text-sm text-[#a1a1aa] leading-relaxed mb-8">{id ? 'Sebelum socket Baileys baru dibuat, Wago mencoba resolve versi WhatsApp Web terbaru. Hasil sukses di-cache selama proses berjalan. Jika remote lookup gagal, Wago memakai versi default/bundled Baileys sebagai fallback sehingga QR pairing tidak bergantung pada hard-coded deployment setting.' : 'Before a new Baileys socket is created, Wago attempts to resolve the latest WhatsApp Web version. A successful result is cached for the process lifetime. If the remote lookup fails, Wago falls back to the Baileys default/bundled version so QR pairing does not depend on a hard-coded deployment setting.'}</p>

  <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-[#fafafa] mb-3">4. Integrate</h2>
  <p class="text-sm text-[#a1a1aa] mb-4">{id ? 'Simpan URL dan API key Wago di secret/config backend aplikasi Anda.' : 'Keep the Wago URL and API key in your application backend secret/config store.'}</p>
  <CodeBlock label="application config" code={`WAGO_URL=https://wago.example.com\nWAGO_API_KEY=wa_...`} />
  <CodeBlock label={id ? 'Arsitektur' : 'Architecture'} code={`Browser / mobile client\n        |\n        v\nApplication backend\n        |\n        | Bearer WAGO_API_KEY\n        v\n       Wago\n        |\n        v\n    WhatsApp`} />
  <Callout title={id ? 'Jangan taruh API key di frontend publik' : 'Do not put the API key in a public frontend'} tone="warning">{id ? 'React/Vue/browser bundle dapat dibaca pengguna. Panggil Wago dari backend/server application Anda.' : 'React/Vue/browser bundles are readable by users. Call Wago from your backend/server application.'}</Callout>

  <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-[#fafafa] mt-9 mb-3">5. {id ? 'Allow recipient saat permission diperoleh' : 'Allow a recipient when permission is obtained'}</h2>
  <CodeBlock label="cURL" code={`export WAGO_URL="https://wago.example.com"\nexport WAGO_API_KEY="wa_..."\n\ncurl -X POST "$WAGO_URL/recipients/allow" \\\n  -H "Authorization: Bearer $WAGO_API_KEY" \\\n  -H "Content-Type: application/json" \\\n  -d '{"phone":"6281234567890","label":"Example recipient"}'`} />
  <p class="text-sm text-[#71717a] mb-8">{id ? 'Allow dilakukan saat aplikasi Anda memang mencatat permission/consent. Jangan otomatis allow sebelum setiap pesan.' : 'Allow a recipient when your application records real permission/consent. Do not automatically allow a recipient before every message.'}</p>

  <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-[#fafafa] mb-3">6. {id ? 'Kirim pesan pertama' : 'Send the first message'}</h2>
  <CodeBlock label="cURL" code={`curl -X POST "$WAGO_URL/messages/send" \\\n  -H "Authorization: Bearer $WAGO_API_KEY" \\\n  -H "Content-Type: application/json" \\\n  -H "Idempotency-Key: first-message-001" \\\n  -d '{"to":"6281234567890","text":"Hello from Wago"}'`} />
  <CodeBlock label="202" code={`{\n  "success": true,\n  "messageId": "...",\n  "status": "pending"\n}`} />
  <Callout title={id ? 'Pending bukan delivered/read' : 'Pending is not delivered/read'} tone="warning">{id ? '202/pending berarti operasi outbound diterima oleh layer Wago/Baileys. Status yang saat ini disimpan adalah pending, accepted, atau rejected.' : '202/pending means the outbound operation was accepted by the Wago/Baileys layer. The currently retained states are pending, accepted, or rejected.'}</Callout>

  <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-[#fafafa] mt-9 mb-3">7. {id ? 'Cek status dan audit' : 'Check status and audit'}</h2>
  <CodeBlock label="cURL" code={`curl "$WAGO_URL/messages/<message-id>/status" \\\n  -H "Authorization: Bearer $WAGO_API_KEY"\n\ncurl "$WAGO_URL/activity?source=baileys&category=connection&limit=20" \\\n  -H "Authorization: Bearer $WAGO_API_KEY"`} />
  <p class="text-sm text-[#71717a]">{id ? 'Message status bersifat transient dan dapat hilang saat restart. Audit event disimpan di SQLite dengan bounded retention 2.000 event dan Baileys metadata disanitasi sebelum persistence.' : 'Message status is transient and may disappear after restart. Audit events are stored in SQLite with bounded retention of 2,000 events, and Baileys metadata is sanitized before persistence.'}</p>

  <div class="mt-9 border border-[#262626] rounded-lg p-5"><h3 class="text-sm font-semibold text-[#fafafa] mb-2">{id ? 'Berikutnya' : 'Next'}</h3><p class="text-sm text-[#71717a]">{id ? 'Buka Referensi API untuk Hybrid API Explorer, semua endpoint, filter audit, error code, dan batas outbound.' : 'Open the API Reference for the Hybrid API Explorer, every endpoint, audit filters, error codes, and outbound limits.'}</p></div>
</DocsLayout>
